# The fisher's catch: he fishes at a lake the generator drew, which holds lake details above 0, and walks back with the fish to lay it on
# his flag. The castle's click places it at 15,5 with its flag at 16,6; the fisher's site at 18,5 has its flag at 19,6 and a road of
# three steps east joins the flags. The shots crop around the node he stands on at each moment.
# Run it on the game view with seed 4455544685788642 and size 1, under either content set:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh fisher-catch --game-view --seed 4455544685788642 --size 1 --fps 10
#   sh tools/play-run.sh fisher-catch --game-view --seed 4455544685788642 --size 1 --fps 10 --content-set basic
expect seed = 4455544685788642
expect size = 1
wait 0.3
click-tile 15 5
wait 0.3
button Fisher
click-tile 18 5
button Fisher
wait 0.3
button Road
click-tile 16 6
click-tile 17 6
click-tile 18 6
click-tile 19 6
button Road
wait 0.3
expect-count road = 4
fast-forward fisher state 0x20 max 60000
wait 0.3
list casting
dump casting
shot cast 21 6 3 3
fast-forward fisher carrying max 60000
wait 0.3
list caught
dump caught
shot caught 21 6 3 3
wait 3
list back
shot back 20 6 3 3
fast-forward until flag-goods:19,6 >= 1 max 20000
wait 0.3
dump flag
shot flag 19 6 3 3
